      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انغمر</span></b>  <i>He immerged, dipped,</i> or <i>plunged, himself,</i> or <i>he became immerged, dipped,</i> or <i>plunged,</i>
(S, K,) in water, (S, TA,) and in a thing; (TA;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغتمر</span></b> . (K.)

